<title>USA: Men's Wearhouse unit completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Men's Wearhouse unit completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Men's Wearhouse on Monday said its unit, Value Priced Clothing Inc, has completed its acquisition of C&amp;R Clothiers in Los Angeles, obtaining 17 C&amp;R stores in southern California, C&amp;R's existing inventory and a lease for C&amp;R's distribution center.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
